# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To the Plaguelands

step Lieutenant Haggerdin
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Fly to Southshore and ride north up the road toward Alterac: Haggerdin camps at Darrow Hill beside it.
  fly "Southshore"
  turnin 7261

step Light's Hope Chapel
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Ride on north to Chillwind Camp and fly to Light's Hope Chapel.
  fly "Light's Hope Chapel"
  turnin 5168                         -- Carlin Redpath
  accept 5206

step Scourge Champions
  tip Scourge Champions (59) roam the Noxious Glade, north of Light's Hope Chapel. Pass Carlin's Mystic Crystal over each one you kill: the skulls that resonate are the ones he wants. Pull them one at a time.
  kill 8529 optional                  -- Scourge Champion
  collect 13155 quest 5206.1 @81.5,44.0 -- Resonating Skull, from the Scourge Champions

step Light's Hope Chapel
  turnin 5206                         -- Carlin Redpath
  accept 5941                         -- Chromie in Andorhal: keep it

step Infiltrator Hameya
  tip Ride north to the Plaguewood's north-eastern edge.
  collect 15767 quest 6024.1          -- Hameya's Key

step The Undercroft
  tip Ride south-west to the Undercroft. The mound of dirt lies inside. Mercutio Filthgorger is elite: grouping up is advised.
  turnin 6024                         -- Mound of Dirt
  collect 14613 quest 5781.1 optional -- Taelan's Hammer, from Mercutio Filthgorger

step The Fungal Vale
  level 57                            -- grind on Diseased Flayer at the Fungal Vale, Eastern Plaguelands

step Ratchet
  hearth "Ratchet"
  tip The next guide starts here in Ratchet.
